# WorkingArea Behavior

## View mode

- Grid cell image area must remain square.
- Image content inside view thumbnails should preserve photo aspect ratio (`contain`), not crop by default.
- View grid controls: columns bounded to 1..8 with default 4.
- View bottom action bar remains fixed height (32px).
- Grid items must not grow beyond visible working area height.

## Edit mode

- Mouse wheel zoom range is fixed to 50%..400%.
- Zoom must be cursor-anchored: the point under cursor stays anchored while zooming.
- Freehand panning is always allowed, even when image is smaller than viewport.
- Pan constraints must clamp at viewport/image boundary collision and avoid jitter/premature lock from rounding.
- “Fit To View” must reset to centered, non-cropped contain fit.
- When worked photo changes (timeline click or selection change), apply fit-to-view behavior.
